      "notes": "Born <strong>24 August 1945 in Butler, Pennsylvania</strong>. Son of <strong>Harry Lloyd Gaddis Jr.</strong> (b. 29 Sep 1916 Denver CO, d. 1996 Butler PA) and <strong>Thelma Grace Hicks</strong> (b. 20 Aug 1914, d. 2001). His siblings: Linda Gaddis Ferrari and Gail Gaddis Magargee. Carries the middle name <strong>\"Beach\"</strong> from his paternal grandmother Edna Vivian Beach (b. 1895 Denver CO) — a tradition continued in his son Jason Beach Gaddis. The <strong>Gaddis</strong> surname is Irish (from <em>Ó Gadhra</em> or a related Co. Monaghan sept) — the line emigrated under the patriarch Adam Gaddis in 1801, settling in Galesburg, Illinois.",
