      "notes": "<p style=\"margin:0.3em 0\"><strong>Eduard Hermann Komitsch</strong> (1848-1882) married <strong>Emma C. Bowes</strong> (1859-1931) on <strong>22 February 1879</strong>. Children: <em>Sophia E. Komitsch</em> (1880-1937) and <em>Herman Edward Komitch</em> (1882-1962). Eduard died young, in 1882 — the same year his son Herman Edward was born.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0.4em 0\">The earlier \"Hermann Komitch 'the mayor' + Nettie Bowes\" entry on the family chart appears to garble these same people: \"Nettie\" was probably a memory of Emma, and the multiple-marriages story matches Emma's real path (widowed by Eduard 1882, then re-married Rev. Julius Grunert at Wanatah, Indiana, 1886).</p>",
