      "notes": "<p style=\"margin:0.3em 0\">Online compiled trees give Gottfried Pschigoda's parents as <strong>Daniel Ferdinand Pschigoda / Przygoda</strong> + <strong>Ernestine Justina Golke</strong>. This is the deepest layer for which any indexed record currently exists, and it is still <em>speculative</em> until a direct parish or census link to William Pschigoda is found.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0.4em 0\">The double-spelling <em>Pschigoda / Przygoda</em> here is consistent with the same family using both Germanized and Polish forms — typical of Lutheran-German settler villages in 19th-century Russian Poland and Volhynia.</p>",
